$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM A mixture of 13 (0.41 g, 0.91 mmol) and mCPBA (1.00 g, 5.3 mmol) in dry
CH2Cl2 (80 mL) was stirred at RT under N2 for 16 h. The reaction mixture
was washed with saturated NaHCO3aq (3 x 80 mL), H2O (80 mL), and brine
(80 mL) and dried (anhydrous MgSO4), then filtered and concentrated under
reduced pressure. Purification by silica column chromatography using 15%
EtOAc/hexane as eluent afforded the corresponding epoxide 14 (0.31 g,
73%).
