$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
((±)-trans-3,4-Dihydroxy-3,4-dihydrodibenz[a,h]anthracene[((±)-1]. The
methanolysis of ((±)-7 (0.6 g, 1.15 mmol) was carried out according to
ref 24.
(+)-(1R,2S,3S,4R)-3,4-Dihydroxy-1,2-epoxy-1,2,3,4-tetrahydrodibenz-[a,h]anthracene[(+)-3]
and (-)-(1S,2R,3R,4S)-3,4-Dihydroxy-1,2-
epoxy-1,2,3,4-tetrahydrodibenz[a,h]anthracene[(-)-3]. Epoxidation of
(-)-1 (20 mg, 0.064 mmol) as described for
((±)-c-3,t-4-Dihydroxy-r-1,2-epoxy-1,2,3,4-tetrahydrodibenz[a,h]-
anthracene[((±)-3] afforded (+)-3 (17.2 mg, 82%). [α]D20 =+43°(c =0.58
mg/mL). By an analogous reaction of (+)-1 (19.2 mg, 0.061 mmol), (-)-3
(18.2 mg, 90%) was obtained:[α]D20 =-37°(c =0.48 mg/mL).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
